WEBVTT

01:49.780 --> 01:54.979
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.009 --> 01:58.030
[Episode 26]

01:59.350 --> 01:59.950
Careful, careful.

01:59.950 --> 02:00.680
Slowly, Honey.

02:00.680 --> 02:01.280
Careful, careful.

02:01.280 --> 02:02.950
Why did you drink so much?

02:02.950 --> 02:04.560
-Here, be careful.
-I didn't drink much.

02:04.560 --> 02:05.150
Easy now, easy.

02:05.150 --> 02:05.640
Hurry!

02:05.640 --> 02:06.990
Let's have two more drinks.

02:06.990 --> 02:07.870
Slow down, slow down.

02:07.870 --> 02:09.070
Take it easy, Father.

02:10.310 --> 02:12.030
Look at you, at your age,

02:12.030 --> 02:13.630
still acting so recklessly.

02:14.770 --> 02:16.280
Keep an eye on him here.

02:16.280 --> 02:18.010
I'll go get some hangover soup.

02:18.240 --> 02:19.370
Don't worry, Madam.

02:21.710 --> 02:23.079
Father, seriously,

02:23.800 --> 02:26.600
if you can't handle alcohol,
don't push yourself.

02:26.770 --> 02:28.630
Why did you have to drink so much?

02:29.190 --> 02:30.720
Look at the state you're in.

02:34.520 --> 02:35.079
Here,

02:35.430 --> 02:36.360
tuck in.

02:44.150 --> 02:45.100
Yimeng.

02:45.240 --> 02:46.030
Father,

02:46.400 --> 02:47.190
I'm here.

02:50.040 --> 02:51.240
You've always been

02:51.910 --> 02:53.910
the one who can't handle hardship.

02:55.190 --> 02:57.850
Being out there isn't like
being in the capital.

02:58.560 --> 03:00.840
You won't have such a big
house to live in,

03:00.840 --> 03:02.970
with so many people to take care of you.

03:04.360 --> 03:06.910
You should reconsider.

03:09.030 --> 03:09.840
Father,

03:10.960 --> 03:12.360
so you already know?

03:17.680 --> 03:18.910
I sometimes

03:19.120 --> 03:20.840
just play dumb.

03:21.960 --> 03:23.820
Not only do I know you're leaving,

03:25.150 --> 03:26.310
but I also know

03:27.190 --> 03:29.710
you're leaving because of Nan Heng.

03:30.400 --> 03:31.190
Right?

03:41.820 --> 03:43.800
I don't know exactly what happened

03:43.800 --> 03:45.430
between you and Nan Heng.

03:46.590 --> 03:48.030
But I believe

03:49.120 --> 03:50.920
if there's a misunderstanding,

03:51.190 --> 03:53.000
you should clear it up.

03:56.520 --> 03:58.310
But what if the problem

03:59.150 --> 04:00.560
isn't with him,

04:02.120 --> 04:03.750
but within my own heart?

04:05.750 --> 04:07.310
When he was a good person,

04:07.840 --> 04:09.640
I trusted him unconditionally.

04:10.360 --> 04:11.840
When he was a bad person,

04:12.840 --> 04:14.800
I confronted him without mercy.

04:16.070 --> 04:17.750
When the good and bad person

04:17.750 --> 04:19.430
were the same person,

04:22.720 --> 04:24.430
I started to hate myself

04:24.950 --> 04:27.390
for no longer being able to trust him.

04:30.670 --> 04:31.480
Father,

04:32.040 --> 04:32.830
tell me.

04:33.920 --> 04:36.120
When a relationship becomes like this,

04:36.560 --> 04:38.090
can it still be called love?

04:39.240 --> 04:41.800
I can't even understand
my own heart anymore.

04:42.390 --> 04:43.950
How can I look to the future?

04:51.830 --> 04:52.840
Very well.

04:55.510 --> 04:57.190
Since you want to go,

04:58.310 --> 05:00.950
I'll have someone escort you to Jiangnan.

05:02.430 --> 05:04.230
When you've figured things out,

05:04.680 --> 05:06.680
I'll send someone to bring you back.

05:14.660 --> 05:19.600
[Laiyi House]

05:26.000 --> 05:26.800
My Lady,

05:27.000 --> 05:28.560
have you really thought this through?

05:28.560 --> 05:30.070
You won't even take me or Zhixia with.

05:30.070 --> 05:31.800
Who will take care of you there?

05:34.560 --> 05:36.390
You have your own plot to follow.

05:36.560 --> 05:38.560
You shouldn't change because of me.

05:42.000 --> 05:43.950
Alright, Yingqiu.

05:44.070 --> 05:45.600
If you really care about me,

05:45.920 --> 05:47.750
just make sure the carriage is spacious

05:47.750 --> 05:49.750
and pack me clothes for all seasons.

05:50.190 --> 05:51.000
Most importantly,

05:51.000 --> 05:53.510
ask the kitchen to prepare
some good food for me,

05:53.510 --> 05:54.270
okay?

05:56.120 --> 05:56.950
Alright, alright,

05:56.950 --> 05:58.560
that's enough, go now.

05:58.560 --> 05:59.270
Just go.

05:59.270 --> 06:00.000
Hurry up.

06:18.040 --> 06:19.170
Where are you going?

06:26.630 --> 06:27.890
How did you get in here?

06:28.430 --> 06:29.390
This is my home.

06:30.480 --> 06:31.840
I know it's your home.

06:32.750 --> 06:35.080
Where are you going with all these things?

06:38.560 --> 06:40.159
I'm going wherever I want.

06:40.390 --> 06:41.920
It's none of your business.

06:43.040 --> 06:44.440
So you're abandoning me?

06:52.270 --> 06:53.980
You're an able-bodied man.

06:54.270 --> 06:55.870
Why should I take care of you?

06:56.750 --> 06:58.720
You know that's not what I meant.

07:09.560 --> 07:10.360
Song Yimeng,

07:10.430 --> 07:11.630
Song... Song Yimeng,

07:11.800 --> 07:12.600
Song Yimeng.

07:15.560 --> 07:17.270
Everything that happened before

07:17.270 --> 07:18.310
was all my fault.

07:19.000 --> 07:19.750
I'm sorry.

07:22.040 --> 07:23.770
Please give me another chance.

07:26.830 --> 07:28.090
What was your fault?

07:28.310 --> 07:29.970
What chance should I give you?

07:32.870 --> 07:33.980
Between us,

07:34.120 --> 07:34.750
you and I...

07:34.750 --> 07:36.010
Enough, stop talking.

07:36.830 --> 07:37.760
I'm telling you,

07:38.430 --> 07:40.070
I won't fall for a liar again,

07:40.630 --> 07:42.290
nor will I be made a fool again.

07:42.510 --> 07:43.510
Meeting you

07:43.950 --> 07:46.120
was like tripping on the road.

07:46.430 --> 07:47.510
I was just unlucky

07:47.680 --> 07:48.810
and I accept that.

07:49.000 --> 07:49.430
I...

07:49.430 --> 07:51.090
So, esteemed Seventh Prince,

07:51.310 --> 07:52.560
leave immediately

07:52.750 --> 07:54.240
and don't ever come back.

08:00.600 --> 08:01.530
I'm not leaving.

08:02.560 --> 08:04.960
No matter what you say today,
I won't leave.

08:06.920 --> 08:08.520
Just give me one more chance.

08:08.560 --> 08:09.120
Just give me one more chance.

08:09.120 --> 08:09.800
Nan Heng!

08:10.500 --> 08:12.370
Can you please stop pestering me?

08:12.480 --> 08:13.160
Just go.

08:13.160 --> 08:13.560
I—

08:13.560 --> 08:14.560
Get out of my house.

08:14.560 --> 08:15.430
Leave now.

08:43.080 --> 08:45.280
What do I have to do
for you to forgive me?

08:46.600 --> 08:48.660
Disappear from my sight completely.

08:48.750 --> 08:50.390
Don't let me hear your voice

08:50.790 --> 08:52.050
or see your face again.

08:56.200 --> 08:57.200
What if I refuse?

09:01.200 --> 09:03.200
Then I'll make you suffer even more.

09:03.510 --> 09:05.960
Since I could expose
Chancellor Gao's affairs,

09:05.960 --> 09:07.390
I can dig up much more.

09:11.910 --> 09:12.720
You mean

09:14.080 --> 09:15.540
you won't marry me anymore

09:16.480 --> 09:18.210
and want to be my enemy instead?

09:19.440 --> 09:20.630
Is this your answer?

09:25.550 --> 09:26.720
So no matter what I do,

09:26.720 --> 09:27.910
you'll never forgive me?

09:27.910 --> 09:28.720
Yes.

09:31.600 --> 09:33.000
I will never forgive you.

09:35.000 --> 09:36.030
Never ever.

09:57.480 --> 09:59.390
What else do you want to ask me?

10:00.510 --> 10:01.790
Do I like you?

10:02.630 --> 10:03.440
I don't.

10:05.240 --> 10:06.390
Do I hate you?

10:07.550 --> 10:08.600
Of course I do.

10:09.720 --> 10:10.960
Would things have been different

10:10.960 --> 10:12.760
had I known earlier
that you were

10:12.960 --> 10:14.320
the same person?

10:16.320 --> 10:17.780
I'm sorry, Your Highness.

10:17.990 --> 10:19.840
If I had known all this earlier,

10:20.840 --> 10:22.320
I would have despised you even more,

10:22.320 --> 10:23.270
hated you even more,

10:23.270 --> 10:24.800
and even killed you sooner.

10:26.910 --> 10:28.000
Do you understand?

10:41.150 --> 10:42.000
I understand.

10:42.360 --> 10:43.790
If you understand,

10:45.390 --> 10:46.360
then get out.

11:14.000 --> 11:17.380
♪ Trample past the abyss ♪

11:18.300 --> 11:22.680
♪ Pick up the ashes of fallen stars ♪

11:26.650 --> 11:29.880
♪ Listen to your memories ♪

11:30.970 --> 11:36.680
♪ Reincarnations are like shadows ♪

11:38.430 --> 11:43.170
♪ After waking, moving against the flow ♪

11:44.520 --> 11:49.170
♪ Even if the kiss lands between
truth and illusion, I’m still willing ♪

11:48.790 --> 11:49.750
Leave now,

11:49.750 --> 11:50.870
get out of my house.

11:50.690 --> 11:54.050
♪ Above all sounds,
the moon flows like silver ♪

11:50.870 --> 11:51.750
Go now!

11:55.490 --> 12:00.920
♪ The stars fall from the sky ♪

12:03.090 --> 12:07.000
♪ Follow the light
and fall into this maze ♪

12:08.190 --> 12:13.450
♪ In the depths of passing time,
who's still waiting ♪

12:14.210 --> 12:16.670
♪ A single glance back ♪

12:17.880 --> 12:22.980
♪ If the vows are vain,
if the journey is too tumultuous ♪

12:23.810 --> 12:27.480
♪ Love and hate intertwine
but won't forget ♪

12:28.680 --> 12:32.780
♪ The light shines,
sighs turn into frost ♪

12:28.720 --> 12:29.510
My Lady,

12:29.550 --> 12:30.960
the kitchen has prepared over
a dozen desserts,

12:30.960 --> 12:31.840
both sour and sweet ones.

12:31.840 --> 12:33.500
Would you like to choose some?

12:33.720 --> 12:38.670
♪ Is there still hope
at the end of the wind and snow? ♪

12:38.150 --> 12:38.960
My Lady,

12:39.750 --> 12:40.840
why are you crying?

12:39.850 --> 12:42.180
♪ Your face ♪

12:43.520 --> 12:45.260
♪ Even if the road ahead is veiled ♪

12:46.770 --> 12:48.290
♪ And the rest of our story
fades unfinished ♪

12:49.520 --> 12:56.660
♪ I'll still choose to meet you ♪

12:53.550 --> 12:54.360
It's nothing.

12:55.360 --> 12:56.620
The wind is too strong.

12:56.910 --> 12:57.840
It got in my eyes.

13:07.280 --> 13:09.170
[Song Residence]

13:07.790 --> 13:08.600
Your...

13:08.790 --> 13:09.600
Uh,

13:09.600 --> 13:10.390
General,

13:10.630 --> 13:11.830
did you see Miss Song?

13:14.150 --> 13:16.150
She said she's leaving the capital.

13:16.150 --> 13:17.210
Where is she going?

13:25.120 --> 13:26.480
Keep an eye on the Song Residence.

13:26.480 --> 13:27.550
Wherever she goes,

13:27.960 --> 13:29.150
ensure her safety.

13:29.630 --> 13:30.510
I understand.

13:33.910 --> 13:34.670
General!

13:35.360 --> 13:36.000
General!

13:37.100 --> 13:37.630
General,

13:37.630 --> 13:38.600
there's news from the palace.

13:38.600 --> 13:42.600
The Noble Consort is going to plead
with His Majesty for Chancellor Gao.

13:50.270 --> 13:53.670
[Fengyi Palace, the late empress' palace]

13:57.540 --> 14:02.620
[Memorial Tablet of Late Empress Yurong]

14:22.270 --> 14:24.630
You shouldn't be here.

14:26.320 --> 14:28.380
I have no other choice, Your Majesty.

14:28.860 --> 14:29.910
Liangzhou is harsh and cold,

14:29.910 --> 14:31.570
with sand storms everywhere.

14:31.630 --> 14:33.120
My brother is too old

14:33.120 --> 14:34.520
to endure such hardship.

14:35.150 --> 14:36.880
I beg for Your Majesty's mercy.

14:37.390 --> 14:39.960
I can give up my title as Noble Consort.

14:39.960 --> 14:41.360
I can go guard the imperial tomb.

14:41.360 --> 14:43.600
I just want my brother to live.

14:43.960 --> 14:44.790
Your Majesty,

14:45.750 --> 14:47.150
I'm begging you.

15:02.720 --> 15:03.520
Your Majesty,

15:04.320 --> 15:06.300
what must I do

15:06.600 --> 15:08.550
for you to spare my brother?

15:13.240 --> 15:16.840
As long as Nan Heng surrenders
the Xuanjia Army's command token,

15:17.910 --> 15:19.960
I can spare Gao Changyin.

15:20.510 --> 15:22.370
But if Heng surrenders the token,

15:22.390 --> 15:23.840
those wolves in the court

15:23.840 --> 15:25.240
will surely harm him!

15:25.240 --> 15:26.730
Wolves?

15:29.120 --> 15:30.340
Do you know

15:30.870 --> 15:34.150
who are the wolves that keep me awake

15:34.150 --> 15:35.390
at night?

15:38.260 --> 15:41.700
They are your precious son
and your dear brother.

15:49.640 --> 15:50.770
My brother

15:51.790 --> 15:53.590
has indeed made grave mistakes.

15:54.840 --> 15:56.580
But what wrong has Heng done?

15:56.790 --> 15:59.790
He personally sent his own uncle
to the imperial prison.

15:59.790 --> 16:00.600
Your Majesty,

16:00.600 --> 16:03.200
why do you still
make things difficult for him?

16:04.120 --> 16:04.960
Is it

16:05.550 --> 16:08.150
just because he is my son?

16:21.720 --> 16:22.520
Fine.

16:24.150 --> 16:26.120
So all the blame

16:26.320 --> 16:28.120
falls on me.

16:32.050 --> 16:34.390
I know my sins are grave.

16:36.150 --> 16:38.190
Please grant me death.

16:40.120 --> 16:41.270
Mother, you don't need to blame yourself.

16:41.270 --> 16:42.150
Get out!

16:43.670 --> 16:44.920
Your Majesty,

16:44.960 --> 16:46.910
I couldn't stop him.

16:48.890 --> 16:49.690
Your Majesty,

16:49.960 --> 16:51.240
everything is my fault.

16:51.240 --> 16:52.790
It has nothing to do with Mother.

16:52.790 --> 16:53.720
Your Majesty,

16:53.740 --> 16:55.140
please do not punish her.

16:55.630 --> 16:57.650
I told you to get out.

16:57.910 --> 16:59.270
Did you not hear me?

17:00.270 --> 17:02.190
Is this a place you should be in?

17:02.600 --> 17:03.720
It's my fault.

17:03.720 --> 17:04.750
I shouldn't have come.

17:04.750 --> 17:06.480
Your Majesty, blame me.

17:06.480 --> 17:07.920
Don't punish Heng.

17:08.240 --> 17:09.030
Very well!

17:09.829 --> 17:11.310
In the Empress's chambers,

17:11.310 --> 17:12.480
you two

17:12.480 --> 17:14.339
still dare to be so presumptuous!

17:16.750 --> 17:17.790
I don't dare.

17:26.400 --> 17:27.329
I don't dare.

17:27.349 --> 17:29.160
I think you definitely dare.

17:30.920 --> 17:32.790
The Empress died because of you.

17:34.310 --> 17:35.640
Do you want her to

17:35.640 --> 17:37.790
not find peace, even in death?

17:38.830 --> 17:40.960
If you weren't my son,

17:40.960 --> 17:42.240
I would have killed you

17:42.240 --> 17:44.030
on that grassland years ago.

17:47.160 --> 17:48.310
I thank Your Majesty

17:49.030 --> 17:50.030
for your mercy.

17:50.270 --> 17:51.030
You...

18:06.680 --> 18:07.310
Fine.

18:07.960 --> 18:08.790
Heng.

18:09.880 --> 18:11.090
There are some things

18:11.480 --> 18:12.540
I need to make clear

18:12.790 --> 18:14.200
to you today.

18:14.790 --> 18:16.310
The position of Crown Prince

18:16.310 --> 18:17.240
has already been

18:17.270 --> 18:18.680
reserved for Rui.

18:19.440 --> 18:22.000
If you truly care about
protecting your mother,

18:22.000 --> 18:22.790
then

18:23.560 --> 18:25.110
hand over the

18:25.220 --> 18:27.270
Xuanjia Army's command token

18:27.760 --> 18:29.010
and I promise

18:29.480 --> 18:31.170
to ensure her safety for life.

18:31.440 --> 18:32.790
Also, from now on,

18:32.960 --> 18:33.960
no one will dare

18:33.960 --> 18:36.200
to interfere with either of you.

18:38.310 --> 18:39.290
Your Majesty,

18:39.590 --> 18:40.920
only the Xuanjia Army

18:41.480 --> 18:42.740
can protect my mother.

18:43.240 --> 18:44.440
If we want to survive,

18:44.960 --> 18:47.020
we must rely on the sword in our hands.

18:47.440 --> 18:49.170
Therefore, I cannot surrender

18:50.310 --> 18:52.240
the Xuanjia Army's command token.

18:54.720 --> 18:55.780
Nan Heng.

18:56.910 --> 18:59.850
Do you truly believe
I don't dare kill you?

19:00.680 --> 19:02.140
Your Majesty is the ruler.

19:02.750 --> 19:03.950
If you order me to die,

19:04.680 --> 19:05.960
I dare not disobey.

19:13.110 --> 19:13.920
Very well.

19:15.070 --> 19:16.550
If you refuse to hand it over,

19:16.550 --> 19:17.640
I will keep you

19:17.660 --> 19:19.340
under house arrest in the capital.

19:19.340 --> 19:21.140
You won't be able to go anywhere,

19:21.350 --> 19:22.790
and the rest of your life

19:22.790 --> 19:25.120
will be spent right under my watch,

19:25.240 --> 19:26.720
barely surviving.

19:31.640 --> 19:33.040
Thank you, Your Majesty.

19:38.730 --> 19:39.880
Get out of my sight!

19:42.510 --> 19:46.590
[Fengyi Palace]

19:47.540 --> 19:48.660
Heng,

19:48.880 --> 19:50.830
we owe your uncle so much.

19:51.350 --> 19:53.680
You must make sure nothing happens to him.

19:54.790 --> 19:55.550
Don't worry, Mother.

19:55.350 --> 20:02.600
[Fengyi Palace]

19:55.550 --> 19:57.160
I'll have my men make sure

19:57.160 --> 19:58.360
that he won't suffer.

20:04.220 --> 20:08.550
[Fengyi Palace]

20:14.070 --> 20:14.900
Your Majesty.

20:14.960 --> 20:16.690
Nan Heng commands his own army.

20:16.750 --> 20:17.510
What if

20:17.640 --> 20:19.480
he uses this opportunity to rebel

20:19.480 --> 20:21.110
in the future?

20:21.270 --> 20:22.440
My son

20:22.960 --> 20:24.900
is none of your concern.

20:25.640 --> 20:26.440
Yes.

20:28.490 --> 20:31.050
[Capital Prefecture's Office]

20:36.070 --> 20:37.480
Come, time to eat!

20:43.550 --> 20:44.720
Eat up, Chancellor.

21:14.750 --> 21:15.550
Chancellor,

21:16.070 --> 21:18.000
the Seventh Prince is occupied
with official matters

21:18.000 --> 21:19.260
and cannot see you off.

21:19.440 --> 21:20.810
Hope you understand.

21:24.960 --> 21:26.630
Decisive when needed,

21:28.240 --> 21:30.400
as expected of the prince

21:30.400 --> 21:31.750
trained by me.

21:34.790 --> 21:35.590
Let's go.

21:35.880 --> 21:36.680
Yes.

21:37.310 --> 21:38.370
Wait, Chancellor.

21:46.640 --> 21:47.570
As we part today,

21:48.070 --> 21:49.730
I fear we may never meet again.

21:50.030 --> 21:51.200
There is one matter

21:51.680 --> 21:53.200
I wish to ask you in person.

21:56.550 --> 21:58.590
Please speak freely, General.

22:00.020 --> 22:01.440
When enemy forces launched
surprise attacks

22:01.440 --> 22:03.180
and captured two cities
during the war years ago,

22:03.180 --> 22:05.440
and Pingrong City was in imminent danger,

22:05.440 --> 22:06.550
I sent a scout

22:06.550 --> 22:08.070
with a handwritten letter requesting aid

22:08.070 --> 22:09.030
to Youcheng,

22:09.160 --> 22:11.110
asking Nan Heng to send reinforcements.

22:11.110 --> 22:12.110
That letter said...

22:12.110 --> 22:13.070
This battle

22:13.680 --> 22:14.960
was to defend

22:15.310 --> 22:17.860
Great Jing's borders and people.

22:18.030 --> 22:20.630
As long as the Xuanjia Army
deployed soldiers,

22:21.160 --> 22:25.110
you would put aside your
years of grievances with him.

22:25.790 --> 22:26.650
You've seen it?

22:28.200 --> 22:29.310
Where's the letter?

22:29.310 --> 22:30.200
Where is it now?

22:31.110 --> 22:34.150
Such evidence must be
thoroughly destroyed.

22:34.400 --> 22:36.720
Otherwise, how could we have
firmly established

22:36.720 --> 22:38.580
your crime for losing the battle?

22:39.070 --> 22:41.590
I raised His Highness for over 20 years,

22:42.550 --> 22:44.610
yet when matters concerned himself,

22:44.790 --> 22:47.510
he turned around and cast me aside.

22:49.200 --> 22:51.160
Such ambitious character.

22:53.240 --> 22:55.830
If you still harbor illusions about him,

22:57.510 --> 22:59.790
no wonder you lost.

23:01.350 --> 23:02.160
It's time.

23:02.160 --> 23:02.720
Let's go.

23:11.510 --> 23:12.310
General,

23:13.640 --> 23:15.040
should we go to the palace

23:15.110 --> 23:17.160
to report this matter to Your Majesty?

23:17.160 --> 23:18.830
With Chancellor Gao's testimony,

23:18.830 --> 23:20.550
perhaps Nan Heng can...

23:25.470 --> 23:34.980
[Song Residence]

23:33.960 --> 23:34.790
My Lady,

23:35.030 --> 23:36.790
must you leave tonight?

23:36.960 --> 23:38.240
Didn't Master say

23:38.240 --> 23:40.880
he would send someone to
escort you tomorrow morning?

23:40.880 --> 23:42.400
You all saw just now

23:42.550 --> 23:44.550
how my father and Yiting were acting.

23:44.550 --> 23:45.950
If I wait until tomorrow,

23:45.960 --> 23:48.350
there will surely be a lot of
emotional nonsense.

23:48.350 --> 23:50.720
But leaving the city so late
might not be safe.

23:50.720 --> 23:52.400
Can you really manage alone?

23:52.680 --> 23:53.510
Don't worry,

23:53.720 --> 23:55.550
my father has arranged everything
along the way.

23:55.550 --> 23:56.720
Nothing will go wrong.

23:56.720 --> 23:57.400
My Lady,

23:57.550 --> 23:58.510
it's time to go.

24:01.680 --> 24:02.750
Then please

24:03.350 --> 24:04.880
take good care of my father.

24:07.200 --> 24:08.000
My Lady,

24:08.550 --> 24:09.880
take good care of yourself.

24:09.880 --> 24:11.750
I'll miss you so much.

24:13.320 --> 24:17.180
[Xuanjia Soldier A]

24:37.850 --> 24:39.080
[Xuanjia Soldier A] [Xuanjia Soldier B]

25:02.740 --> 25:10.110
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

25:10.750 --> 25:11.510
General!

25:12.550 --> 25:13.350
General!

25:13.790 --> 25:14.550
General!

25:14.680 --> 25:15.480
General!

25:15.750 --> 25:16.720
Did something happen?

25:16.720 --> 25:17.350
Miss Song

25:17.350 --> 25:18.160
is in danger

25:18.350 --> 25:19.350
in Huyang Forest.

25:21.810 --> 25:22.770
What?

25:38.790 --> 25:39.750
Sir,

25:39.920 --> 25:41.160
why did you stop?

25:43.240 --> 25:44.070
Sir,

25:44.110 --> 25:45.390
where are you going?

25:47.920 --> 25:48.480
Sir?

25:48.680 --> 25:49.510
Sir!

25:49.830 --> 25:50.310
S—

25:56.640 --> 25:57.310
No, wait.

25:57.930 --> 25:59.150
This is Huyang Bamboo Forest.

25:59.150 --> 26:05.900
[Dream of Qingning
Episode 26, Scene 16]

26:06.960 --> 26:08.290
Who are you people

26:08.590 --> 26:10.390
and why are you trying to kill me?

26:17.150 --> 26:22.290
♪ Who drinks in the wind
as snow turns to ash? ♪

26:19.960 --> 26:20.590
Yimeng,

26:21.400 --> 26:22.660
I've arrived too late.

26:24.240 --> 26:25.270
Here it comes.

26:25.300 --> 26:26.460
It's that scene.

26:46.310 --> 26:47.660
In the original script,

26:47.750 --> 26:49.680
Song Yimeng was angry at Nan Heng due to

26:49.680 --> 26:51.000
what happened at Zijin Pavilion,

26:51.000 --> 26:51.930
so

26:52.350 --> 26:54.120
she was attacked by assassins
dressed in black.

26:54.120 --> 26:56.740
It was Nan Heng's ploy to
win her heart again

26:56.880 --> 26:59.030
by saving the damsel in distress.

26:59.510 --> 27:00.680
So what's going on

27:00.680 --> 27:01.910
this time?

27:01.960 --> 27:03.230
Search thoroughly

27:03.350 --> 27:04.350
and if you find her,

27:04.350 --> 27:05.370
kill her on the spot.

27:05.370 --> 27:06.240
Yes!

27:10.630 --> 27:17.270
[Dream of Qingning
Episode 26, Scene 19]

27:11.830 --> 27:12.480
Go.

27:13.110 --> 27:13.680
Quickly!

27:16.550 --> 27:17.410
Your Highness,

27:17.550 --> 27:18.850
you're bleeding.

27:19.480 --> 27:20.240
Don't be afraid, Yimeng.

27:20.240 --> 27:21.130
I'm fine.

27:22.200 --> 27:23.110
But those men

27:23.110 --> 27:23.830
won't give up

27:23.830 --> 27:25.030
until they catch us.

27:27.200 --> 27:27.990
There is

27:28.240 --> 27:29.650
a secluded cave ahead

27:29.960 --> 27:31.360
where we can hide for now.

27:31.750 --> 27:32.590
Before dawn,

27:32.610 --> 27:33.790
the Xuanjia Army will surely find us.

27:33.790 --> 27:34.440
Alright.

27:35.310 --> 27:35.880
Let's go.

27:38.790 --> 27:40.960
I have no choice but to
make the best of it.

27:40.960 --> 27:41.870
Let me

27:42.120 --> 27:43.180
borrow your cave.

28:23.680 --> 28:24.550
Song Yimeng!

28:25.030 --> 28:25.890
Your Highness,

28:25.960 --> 28:27.270
your wounds haven't healed yet.

28:27.270 --> 28:27.930
Be careful!

28:28.920 --> 28:29.680
Everyone,

28:29.680 --> 28:30.830
spread out and search for her.

28:30.830 --> 28:31.480
Yes!

28:31.750 --> 28:32.400
Search!

28:32.640 --> 28:33.440
Song Yimeng!

29:04.790 --> 29:06.650
This time, I'll handle it myself.

29:10.920 --> 29:11.520
After her!

29:26.070 --> 29:26.830
Boss.

29:27.070 --> 29:28.880
Wasn't she supposed to be
just an official's daughter?

29:28.880 --> 29:30.340
How can she be so ruthless?

29:30.550 --> 29:32.680
No matter how ruthless,
she's still just a weak woman.

29:32.680 --> 29:34.540
Find her and kill her, that's all.

29:36.860 --> 29:43.740
[Dream of Qingning,
Episode 26, Scene 24]

29:49.260 --> 29:50.350
I'm right here.

29:51.190 --> 29:52.070
Kill her!

29:56.070 --> 29:57.550
How does this woman have so many tricks?

29:57.550 --> 29:59.410
She's hidden traps in this place.

30:01.310 --> 30:02.000
Kill her!

30:31.400 --> 30:32.330
Are you alright?

30:33.550 --> 30:34.350
Were those

30:34.750 --> 30:35.920
your men?

30:37.270 --> 30:38.200
What do you mean?

30:52.430 --> 30:53.460
Are you okay?

30:55.680 --> 30:56.860
You're bleeding.

30:59.240 --> 31:00.040
It's nothing.

31:04.650 --> 31:05.730
They've caught up.

31:09.790 --> 31:10.720
Go down this way.

31:10.820 --> 31:12.280
You take the small path first.

31:12.280 --> 31:13.480
Don't worry about me.

31:13.480 --> 31:15.140
I'll stay behind to cover you.

31:15.270 --> 31:16.070
Run!

31:19.600 --> 31:20.750
He won't die, he won't die.

31:20.750 --> 31:22.440
Plot armor! Plot armor!

31:23.000 --> 31:23.550
He won't die.

31:23.550 --> 31:24.400
He won't die.

31:24.400 --> 31:25.060
Plot armor.

31:26.720 --> 31:28.400
No need to run away so quickly.

31:37.590 --> 31:39.640
We only want that woman's life.

31:39.790 --> 31:41.350
You can still leave now.

31:43.160 --> 31:43.960
Tell me,

31:44.640 --> 31:45.640
who sent you?

31:46.270 --> 31:48.600
So you're not planning to step aside?

31:50.030 --> 31:51.310
Think carefully.

31:51.480 --> 31:52.680
You're injured.

31:52.680 --> 31:54.220
You're no match for us.

31:54.310 --> 31:55.590
Is this worth it

31:55.790 --> 31:56.590
for a woman?

32:00.070 --> 32:00.480
Kill!

32:24.270 --> 32:25.540
Are you okay?

32:26.240 --> 32:27.500
You're bleeding.

32:28.060 --> 32:29.210
Will he die?

32:29.640 --> 32:30.720
He's the male lead.

32:31.110 --> 32:32.790
In the script world,

32:33.240 --> 32:34.550
he should be fine.

32:35.240 --> 32:36.910
And a female lead who can't fight

32:36.910 --> 32:38.970
will only get in the way by going back.

33:04.160 --> 33:05.160
Why did you come back?

33:05.160 --> 33:05.970
Run!

33:06.590 --> 33:07.240
Come on!

33:14.610 --> 33:15.760
Jump down with me!

33:16.110 --> 33:16.790
Are you crazy?

33:16.790 --> 33:17.830
We'll die if we jump!

33:17.830 --> 33:19.030
Just trust me this once.

33:19.030 --> 33:20.400
In this world, jumping off a cliff

33:20.400 --> 33:21.550
definitely won't kill us!

33:21.550 --> 33:22.860
No way I'll trust you!

33:24.790 --> 33:26.000
Holy crap,

33:26.110 --> 33:28.240
why is it so high up?

33:40.240 --> 33:41.110
General,

33:41.200 --> 33:42.270
we've checked.

33:42.790 --> 33:44.680
There were at least four containers
of petroleum tied to the prison cart.

33:44.680 --> 33:45.900
He must be dead.

33:46.200 --> 33:48.130
It must have been set up in advance.

33:49.310 --> 33:51.000
Such ruthlessness.

33:51.440 --> 33:52.770
That's Nan Heng for you.

33:53.250 --> 33:54.110
General,

33:54.550 --> 33:55.350
Nan Heng

33:55.440 --> 33:57.440
could even kill his own uncle.

34:00.120 --> 34:01.110
I had planned

34:01.200 --> 34:02.550
to use Gao Changyin as a witness

34:02.550 --> 34:04.150
to reopen the Pingrong case.

34:04.680 --> 34:05.720
Since I thought of it,

34:05.720 --> 34:07.650
he could naturally think of it too.

34:07.920 --> 34:09.380
Chancellor Gao was right.

34:09.800 --> 34:11.480
Eliminating a problem at its source

34:11.480 --> 34:12.800
is indeed his nature.

34:14.469 --> 34:15.670
Have our men come over

34:15.670 --> 34:16.880
to take the body back.

34:17.280 --> 34:18.070
I will

34:18.280 --> 34:20.010
investigate this thoroughly.

34:20.960 --> 34:21.760
This time,

34:22.590 --> 34:25.050
I won't give him any
opportunity to exploit.

34:25.230 --> 34:26.360
Yes, General.

34:28.920 --> 34:29.960
Nan Heng,

34:29.960 --> 34:30.960
how are you?

34:43.880 --> 34:44.670
My God.

34:45.920 --> 34:47.330
Why is it so cold?

34:50.070 --> 34:50.780
Nan Heng,

34:52.000 --> 34:53.600
wake up and tell me

34:54.510 --> 34:55.989
what was with

34:56.070 --> 34:57.840
all those assassins just now.

35:00.630 --> 35:01.360
Nan Heng,

35:01.360 --> 35:02.480
wake up.

35:02.550 --> 35:03.670
Say something!

35:12.220 --> 35:12.970
Nan Heng?

35:15.000 --> 35:16.070
Stop pretending.

35:16.630 --> 35:18.240
I've never seen a male lead

35:18.320 --> 35:19.800
die from jumping off a cliff.

35:19.800 --> 35:20.670
Stop faking it!

35:28.760 --> 35:29.290
Nan Heng.

35:31.000 --> 35:31.630
Nan Heng.

35:41.530 --> 35:42.390
Nan Heng?

35:42.960 --> 35:44.400
Nan Heng, don't scare me like this.

35:44.400 --> 35:45.140
Nan Heng!

35:45.230 --> 35:45.960
Nan Heng!

35:47.070 --> 35:48.710
We're in the middle of nowhere.

35:48.710 --> 35:50.040
What am I supposed to do?

35:50.800 --> 35:52.000
I'm telling you,

35:52.110 --> 35:53.630
I don't care if you live or die.

35:53.630 --> 35:54.890
Wake up now,

35:54.940 --> 35:56.030
do you hear me?

35:56.440 --> 35:57.110
Nan Heng!

35:57.760 --> 35:58.670
Nan Heng!

35:59.400 --> 36:00.360
Nan Heng!

36:01.440 --> 36:02.650
This is a script world.

36:02.650 --> 36:05.300
Scripts always have clichés.

36:15.360 --> 36:16.370
Nan Heng.

36:16.430 --> 36:17.960
Please wake up!

36:35.180 --> 36:36.580
Why aren't you waking up?

36:37.280 --> 36:40.140
Don't people in costume dramas
wake up after a kiss?

36:40.630 --> 36:41.370
Nan Heng.

36:41.710 --> 36:42.510
Nan Heng!

36:42.800 --> 36:43.480
Nan Heng.

37:02.750 --> 37:03.550
Nan Heng.

37:04.670 --> 37:06.180
You can't die.

37:06.420 --> 37:08.100
I haven't forgiven you yet.

37:08.120 --> 37:10.060
What gives you the right to die first?

37:10.060 --> 37:11.230
Get up now!

37:13.230 --> 37:14.760
If you can't do something,

37:14.830 --> 37:16.480
don't make empty promises.

37:17.240 --> 37:18.730
Who asked you to save anyone?

37:18.730 --> 37:20.180
Why did you have to play hero?

37:20.180 --> 37:21.700
Who needs your protection?

37:21.700 --> 37:22.520
Get up now.

37:22.550 --> 37:24.280
Wake up, do you hear me?

37:24.300 --> 37:25.400
I told you,

37:25.400 --> 37:26.930
I haven't forgiven you yet.

37:26.930 --> 37:28.320
Get up right now!

37:28.320 --> 37:28.960
Nan Heng.

37:29.040 --> 37:29.820
Nan Heng.

37:30.050 --> 37:31.080
Nan Heng!

37:31.280 --> 37:32.320
Please wake up.

37:32.320 --> 37:34.080
Please wake up now!

37:38.400 --> 37:39.200
You're awake?

37:43.410 --> 37:44.890
You finally woke up.

37:44.920 --> 37:47.030
I thought you were going to die.

37:53.630 --> 37:55.560
Couldn't you say something nicer?

38:00.690 --> 38:01.730
You didn't die.

38:01.880 --> 38:03.810
Why were you pretending to be dead?

38:03.980 --> 38:05.840
You did it on purpose, didn't you?

38:06.230 --> 38:07.960
I just fell off a cliff

38:08.080 --> 38:09.320
and barely survived.

38:10.180 --> 38:11.830
Give me a break, will you?

38:20.670 --> 38:22.330
How did your hand get injured?

38:24.710 --> 38:26.150
What's it to you?

38:26.400 --> 38:27.310
Don't touch me.

38:30.770 --> 38:32.230
You got hurt because of me?

38:32.840 --> 38:34.370
Stop flattering yourself.

38:34.850 --> 38:37.030
You'd better worry about yourself.

38:37.210 --> 38:38.670
You've lost so much blood.

38:38.710 --> 38:39.910
Don't die on me again.

38:44.590 --> 38:46.320
Wouldn't it be better if I died?

38:46.480 --> 38:48.590
Then you wouldn't have to cry like this

38:48.590 --> 38:50.320
and still refuse to forgive me.

38:56.630 --> 38:57.890
It's too exposed here.

38:59.380 --> 39:01.040
The assassins might catch up.

39:01.440 --> 39:03.100
Let's find somewhere to hide.

39:12.250 --> 39:12.950
Let's go.

39:16.100 --> 39:16.920
You...

39:17.230 --> 39:19.070
I-I'm injured

39:19.400 --> 39:20.340
because of you.

39:23.710 --> 39:24.510
Let's go.

39:38.880 --> 39:39.670
Careful.

39:39.710 --> 39:40.640
Sit there first.

39:43.610 --> 39:44.620
Take it easy.

39:48.800 --> 39:50.530
We're in the middle of nowhere,

39:50.760 --> 39:51.630
and you're injured.

39:51.630 --> 39:53.160
Will we ever get out of here?

39:53.590 --> 39:54.400
Don't worry.

39:54.670 --> 39:55.670
If Fugui can't find me,

39:55.670 --> 39:57.400
he'll surely bring
the Xuanjia Army to search,

39:57.400 --> 39:58.190
and by

39:58.190 --> 39:59.940
dawn at the latest, they'll find us.

39:59.940 --> 40:01.000
Tomorrow morning?

40:02.090 --> 40:03.550
With injuries like yours,

40:03.670 --> 40:05.550
I'm afraid you won't make it till then.

40:05.550 --> 40:07.480
You'll freeze to death here first.

40:13.190 --> 40:14.000
Here.

40:14.880 --> 40:15.670
Help me

40:16.400 --> 40:17.730
gather these branches,

40:18.670 --> 40:19.480
and then

40:19.760 --> 40:21.400
find a thicker stick.

40:23.000 --> 40:24.190
Are you trying to

40:25.760 --> 40:27.290
make fire by drilling wood?

41:25.360 --> 41:26.190
Bro,

41:27.230 --> 41:28.760
can you do it or not?

41:29.550 --> 41:30.690
Why don't you try?

41:34.170 --> 41:35.130
No, no,

41:35.230 --> 41:36.280
you go ahead.

42:00.400 --> 42:01.190
You did it!

42:15.710 --> 42:16.710
How was that?

42:17.000 --> 42:18.400
I did pretty well, right?

42:20.430 --> 42:22.160
It took you an hour

42:23.230 --> 42:24.630
and you're proud of that?

42:25.590 --> 42:28.030
I've seen male leads in other scripts

42:28.050 --> 42:29.710
who succeed in one swift move.

42:33.000 --> 42:33.920
Well, did your script

42:33.920 --> 42:34.960
ever mention

42:35.190 --> 42:37.250
that jumping off cliffs can kill you?

42:38.070 --> 42:39.190
Did you die?

42:41.070 --> 42:42.330
I got injured.

42:42.550 --> 42:44.550
That was from the assassin's blade.

42:45.000 --> 42:46.150
Besides,

42:46.550 --> 42:47.400
I've never seen

42:47.400 --> 42:49.400
any protagonist in a costume drama

42:49.400 --> 42:50.920
who actually died
from jumping off a cliff.

42:50.920 --> 42:52.400
Ever heard of plot armor?

42:54.710 --> 42:56.970
I have no idea what you're talking about.

43:09.000 --> 43:09.760
Alright,

43:10.110 --> 43:12.570
stop acting tough
when you're so badly hurt.

43:21.190 --> 43:22.000
Song Yimeng.

43:25.190 --> 43:26.960
I didn't send those assassins.

43:30.230 --> 43:31.030
I know.

43:35.480 --> 43:36.400
Then why did you

43:37.110 --> 43:38.480
come back to save me?

43:45.760 --> 43:47.070
Because

43:48.190 --> 43:49.550
I made a bet with myself.

43:51.620 --> 43:52.400
What bet?

44:03.150 --> 44:04.230
Did you win?
